---
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import Breadcrumbs from '../../components/Breadcrumbs.astro';
const lastUpdated = 'August 25, 2026';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Disclaimer"
  description="Legal disclaimer: USAPrizes.com is 18+/21+ informational content, not affiliated with any state lottery, and not gambling."
>
  <section class="section">
    <div class="wrap prose">
      <Breadcrumbs items={[{ name: 'Disclaimer', href: '/disclaimer/' }]} />
      <h1>Disclaimer</h1>
      <p class="updated">Last updated: {lastUpdated}</p>

      <h2>Age restriction</h2>
      <p>
        This site is intended for users 18 years of age or older (21+ in states where that is
        the applicable minimum age for sweepstakes or promotional-sweepstakes participation). By
        using this site you represent that you meet the applicable minimum age in your
        jurisdiction.
      </p>

      <h2>Not affiliated with any state lottery</h2>
      <p>
        USAPrizes.com is an independent publisher. We are not affiliated with, sponsored by, or
        endorsed by any U.S. state lottery, the Multi-State Lottery Association, the operators
        of Powerball or Mega Millions, or any government agency. Winning numbers and jackpot
        figures published here are sourced from public data feeds and are provided for
        informational purposes only. They may contain errors or delays. Always confirm results
        against your official state lottery before relying on them, including before discarding
        or claiming a ticket.
      </p>

      <h2>Sweepstakes casinos are not gambling</h2>
      <p>
        The "sweepstakes casino" operators reviewed on this site operate under state
        promotional-sweepstakes and prize-competition laws, which are legally distinct from
        real-money online gambling. No purchase is necessary to participate, and free
        alternative methods of entry are typically required by law. That said, sweepstakes
        casino legality varies by state and is currently restricted or prohibited in some
        states, and the legal landscape continues to change. Nothing on this site should be
        taken as legal advice about whether a given operator is permitted in your state &mdash;
        confirm current availability directly with the operator and consult your own legal
        counsel if you have questions.
      </p>

      <h2>No guarantee of outcomes</h2>
      <p>
        We do not guarantee that any sweepstakes casino, promotion, or lottery outcome described
        on this site will produce any particular result. Redemption values, bonus terms, and
        odds are set by third-party operators and lottery commissions and are subject to change
        without notice.
      </p>

      <h2>Problem gambling resources</h2>
      <p>
        If gambling or sweepstakes play stops being fun, free and confidential help is available
        24/7 from the National Problem Gambling Helpline: call or text 1-800-522-4700.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
